  "name": "Healing aura",
  "description": "A restorative buff with no caster in frame: a five-strand green ribbon sweeps once around hip height over the first 1.2 s and dives into the ground as it goes, a swirling three-strand ring with a soft pulsing inner fill snaps on underneath it at 1.2 s, a tapered open glow cylinder rises through the ring and holds to 2.7 s, four-point sparkles twinkle upward out of the ring through the hold, and from 2.7 s the cylinder fades while the sparks keep rising, the ring and the sparks ending together at 6 s over a warm green ground bounce.",
